{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibus Moon Rock is a sandbox game set in a fantasy space world where your creations will attract new critters. <br>Collect new pets, discover new biomes and unlock hundreds of items in a far away galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/ee87b4579e214f9d488f75750af064a9.poster.avif?t=1772585756\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/ee87b4579e214f9d488f75750af064a9.webm?t=1772585756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/ee87b4579e214f9d488f75750af064a9.mp4?t=1772585756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILDING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create colourful forests, build farms, villages or cities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build on any new moon you discover. Building brings you a vast array of colours while you mix and match building parts to make your moon city as unique as your\u00a0imagination will let it be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/d7e393e59b1eb369c8aff2cb94df1d0c.poster.avif?t=1772585756\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/d7e393e59b1eb369c8aff2cb94df1d0c.webm?t=1772585756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/d7e393e59b1eb369c8aff2cb94df1d0c.mp4?t=1772585756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KIBOT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibot its a robot created by Kibus to help out with building new worlds and to bring some fun your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either you will be looking to destroy your placements or to change your building, the Kibot will be there to help you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KIBUS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibus are the spacehogs that will join your moons once you start creating your world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fun space species loves to hang around and have a good time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pet the critters and play with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets will also appear and bring new life to your world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them and unlock new species and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/91b09d6b4307980ea3b213a433c9814d.poster.avif?t=1772585756\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/91b09d6b4307980ea3b213a433c9814d.webm?t=1772585756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/91b09d6b4307980ea3b213a433c9814d.mp4?t=1772585756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COZY CITY BUILDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the freedom to build at your own pace as there is no economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The game features a gridless world so placements can go anywhere.<br>Just relax and enjoy creating your dream moon world!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734110?t=1772585756","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/8d0ebc51ecfa56e81f97fa71ca6fffbddcebedeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772585756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/caf41e8cf828d7b89b389f757f059d55a6072f12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772585756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/caf41e8cf828d7b89b389f757f059d55a6072f12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772585756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibus Moon Rock is a sandbox game set in a fantasy space world where your creations will attract new critters. <br>Collect new pets, discover new biomes and unlock hundreds of items in a far away galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/ee87b4579e214f9d488f75750af064a9.poster.avif?t=1772585756\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/ee87b4579e214f9d488f75750af064a9.webm?t=1772585756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/ee87b4579e214f9d488f75750af064a9.mp4?t=1772585756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILDING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create colourful forests, build farms, villages or cities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build on any new moon you discover. Building brings you a vast array of colours while you mix and match building parts to make your moon city as unique as your\u00a0imagination will let it be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\